WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:06.596
The same tool on the command line: same engine as the GUI. Messages are in Romanian.

2
00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:13.033
Give it a site or a folder; each report’s format is chosen by its extension.

3
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:18.060
Broken links are listed together with the page that contains each one.

4
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:25.076
“lint” analyses files offline: scheme typos, tracking parameters, http instead of https.

5
00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:30.133
“fix” proposes repairs. Without --apply nothing is written.

6
00:00:30.617 --> 00:00:40.933
With --apply, the change is written with a backup and a journal entry.

7
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:48.400
“undo” restores the original files byte for byte.

